  "这里展示的是当前用户素材库中的图片和视频素材。可多选，选中后会直接加入当前模板混剪。": "Displayed here are the pictures and video materials in the current user material library. Multiple selections are possible. Once selected, the current template will be directly added to the mix and cut.",
