  "这里展示全网补全后的客户档案；阿里原始属性只保留在询盘详情。": "The completed customer files of the entire network are displayed here; Ali's original attributes are only retained in the inquiry details.",
  "这里直接添加和管理抖音获客账号，登录会打开抖音前台页面，不走创作者中心。": "Add and manage Douyin customer acquisition accounts directly here. Login will open the Douyin front page without going to the Creator Center.",
