  "这是定位和预览，不等于真正语义拆件。": "This is positioning and preview and does not equal true semantic disassembly.",
  "这条历史任务暂时还没有可加载的图片，你可以先查看提示词或刷新任务状态。": "There are currently no images available for loading for this historical task. You can check the prompts or refresh the task status first.",
